## Overview

The **Laptop Forecast App** helps IT procurement teams plan and forecast laptop purchase needs per quarter. It provides a data-driven dashboard that calculates purchase requirements based on current stock, demand drivers (tech refresh, break/fix, new hires), and rolling quarter history.

### Key Features

- 📊 **Executive Dashboard** — Real-time KPIs for New Hires, Order Value, and Purchase Units
- 🗓️ **Quarterly Planning** — Switch between fiscal quarters (FY26–FY28)
- 🔄 **Rolling Forecast** — Lookback logic auto-calculates Effective Opening Stock from the previous quarter
- 💰 **Regional Pricing** — Per-region, per-model pricing saved per quarter
- 📂 **Bulk Stock Upload** — Import CSV stock reports to populate inventory
- 📄 **PDF Purchase Orders** — Generate procurement-ready PDF reports
- 📥 **CSV Export** — Download detailed forecast data
- 🌗 **Dark Mode** — Built-in toggle for dark theme
- 🌍 **Cross-Platform** — Runs on Windows and macOS

