## How It Works

### Forecast Formula

```
Total Demand = Backlog Tech Refresh + Break Fix + (Tech Refresh Eligibility × Adoption Rate) + New Hires
Effective Opening Stock = Physical Stock − Previous Quarter Demand
Target Stock Level = Total Demand + Buffer
Purchase Needs = max(0, ⌈Target Stock Level − Effective Opening Stock⌉)
Total Cost = Purchase Needs × Unit Price
```

### Stock Upload (CSV)

Upload a CSV from your asset management system (e.g., ServiceNow). The parser maps:

| CSV Column | Maps To |
|---|---|
| `model.short_description` | Model (MacBook 14", 16", SL7) |
| `location` / `location.u_geographic_region` | Region |
| `model.ref_cmdb_hardware_product_model.u_keyboard_language` | Language |

**Special mapping rules:**
- "Nordic" keyboard → mapped to "Swedish" (v3.6)
- Location codes: MLN8 → UK, LSP3 → LATAM, LMX1/LSNX → NAMER, MTV → Tel Aviv

