## Troubleshooting

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| `python` not recognized | Install Python 3.10+ and ensure it's added to PATH |
| `pyinstaller` not found | Run `pip install pyinstaller` |
| macOS "Unidentified Developer" | System Settings → Privacy & Security → Open Anyway |
| CSV upload fails | Ensure the CSV contains `model.short_description` column |
| Data not saving | Check `settings.json` database path is writable |

